//   Inside-close branch: CloseConstrainedSpan sets insideConstrainedOut to false,
//   so the implication is vacuous afterward. Inside-append branch: both
//   GroupBoostedConstrainedStep and ConstrainedStep guarantee either EOS or a
//   parser-valid next token; on the non-EOS path, AppendConstrainedToken or the
//   postcondition of ConstrainedStep preserves parser validity.
//
