//   - `currentConstrainedOut`: the contents of that active span, excluding delimiters
//   - `steps`: one unit of budget per decoding action
//
// Outside a span, generation is unconstrained so the model can write natural
// explanatory text. When the model emits `"<<"`, the strategy opens a
// constrained arithmetic segment and starts tracking only the span contents.
// Inside a span, the strategy uses an adaptive constrained sampler over the
// parser-valid next tokens, optionally boosted by caller-supplied
// `validTokenGroups`. This lets the parser enforce well-formed arithmetic while
// still allowing soft preference among valid tokens. As soon as the parser says
// the arithmetic fragment is complete, the strategy closes the span with `">>"`.
// EOS is always terminal.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN
